<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?><tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" itunes:timing="Word"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"><ttm:name type="full">ずっと真夜中でいいのに。 (永远是深夜有多好｡)</ttm:name></ttm:agent><iTunesMetadata xmlns="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal"><songwriters><songwriter>ACAね</songwriter></songwriters><translations><translation type="subtitle" xml:lang="zh-Hans"><text for="L1">Bow</text><text for="L2">尽管因为不想暴露而没有唱出来</text><text for="L3">却不意味着我并没这么想</text><text for="L4">总是在思考别离的人生</text><text for="L5">也拥有着积极的欢喜</text><text for="L6">短暂的相见一定并不足够</text><text for="L7">对话的一点一滴 都以歌词牢记着</text><text for="L8">虽然</text><text for="L9">面对看过来的黏腻狭长目光很是愁闷</text><text for="L10">但我也厌倦了随时做好逃跑的准备</text><text for="L11">无论与你有过多少次接触</text><text for="L12">应对的机敏 大概也只有些许</text><text for="L13">不禁只好隐藏起 徒劳无用的真心</text><text for="L14">请不要来了解我</text><text for="L15">请不要斥责这是因果报应</text><text for="L16">请不要来了解我</text><text for="L17">请不要斥责这是因果报应</text><text for="L18">请不要来了解我</text><text for="L19">请不要斥责这是因果报应</text><text for="L20">请不要讨厌我</text><text for="L21">请为我的表演打动</text><text for="L22">难以自控地享受其中</text><text for="L23">如果没有旋律 谈话也会索然无味</text><text for="L24">害怕立于旋转灯球之下</text><text for="L25">但若是换一张厚颜无耻的脸皮</text><text for="L26">大概也能够忍着羞耻起舞</text><text for="L27">可一直以来我如此肤浅</text><text for="L28">尽管现在还不愿离开回家</text><text for="L29">什么也不要说 我快不习惯自己的身体了</text><text for="L30">我会努力 做出更多的改变</text><text for="L31">呐 请为我见证吧 即使只是些渴望</text><text for="L32">其实我并没有</text><text for="L33">羞于表达</text><text for="L34">自己究竟作何想法</text><text for="L35">只是更想唱响</text><text for="L36">快乐的永远歌</text><text for="L37">所以就让我压抑住本心吧 仅此而已</text><text for="L38">虽然我总是不经意间</text><text for="L39">转眼就会陷入否定情绪中</text><text for="L40">即使这个世界所有的歌都被写尽了</text><text for="L41">也希望你能向我转身</text><text for="L42">为你献上最后的歌</text><text for="L43">某人颤动的睫毛 令人精疲力竭的变更时间表</text><text for="L44">尽管黑夜漫长 麻痹自身我也会继续拼命努力</text><text for="L45">请为我的表演打动</text><text for="L46">难以自控地享受其中</text><text for="L47">如果没有旋律 谈话也会索然无味</text><text for="L48">害怕立于旋转灯球之下</text><text for="L49">但若是换一张厚颜无耻的脸皮</text><text for="L50">呐 请为我见证吧 即使只是些渴望</text><text for="L51">请不要来了解我</text><text for="L52">请不要斥责这是因果报应</text><text for="L53">请不要来了解我</text><text for="L54">请不要斥责这是因果报应</text><text for="L55">请不要来认识我</text><text for="L56">请不要斥责这是因果报应</text><text for="L57">请不要讨厌我</text><text for="L58">Bow</text><text for="L59">请为我的表演打动</text><text for="L60">难以自控地享受其中</text><text for="L61">如果旋律如诉如泣 谈话也会索然无味</text><text for="L62">害怕立于旋转灯球之下</text><text for="L63">但若是换一张厚颜无耻的脸皮</text><text for="L64">大概也能够忍着羞耻起舞</text><text for="L65">可一直以来我如此肤浅</text><text for="L66">尽管现在还不愿离开回家</text><text for="L67">什么也不要说 身体已经快要发不出声音</text><text for="L68">我会努力 做出更多的改变</text><text for="L69">睡吧 请为我见证吧 即使只是些渴望</text><text for="L70">Bow</text></translation></translations></iTunesMetadata></metadata></head><body><div itunes:song-part="Intro"><p begin="0:16.612" end="0:17.131" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:16.612" end="0:17.131">Bow</span></p></div><div itunes:song-part="Verse"><p begin="0:31.852" end="0:35.800" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:31.852" end="0:32.245">バ</span><span begin="0:32.245" end="0:32.619">レ</span><span begin="0:32.796" end="0:33.077">た</span><span begin="0:33.077" end="0:33.259">く</span><span begin="0:33.259" end="0:33.507">は</span><span begin="0:33.507" end="0:33.675">な</span><span begin="0:33.675" end="0:33.796">い</span><span begin="0:33.796" end="0:33.964">か</span><span begin="0:33.964" end="0:34.008">ら</span> <span begin="0:34.383" end="0:34.879">歌</span><span begin="0:34.879" end="0:35.040">わ</span><span begin="0:35.040" end="0:35.191">な</span><span begin="0:35.191" end="0:35.359">い</span><span begin="0:35.359" end="0:35.552">け</span><span begin="0:35.552" end="0:35.800">ど</span></p><p begin="0:36.255" end="0:38.754" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:36.255" end="0:36.598">想</span><span begin="0:36.598" end="0:36.750">っ</span><span begin="0:36.750" end="0:36.928">て</span><span begin="0:36.928" end="0:37.103">な</span><span begin="0:37.103" end="0:37.255">い</span><span begin="0:37.255" end="0:37.423">と</span><span begin="0:37.423" end="0:37.650">か</span><span begin="0:37.650" end="0:37.896">じ</span><span begin="0:37.897" end="0:38.143">ゃ</span><span begin="0:38.143" end="0:38.337">な</span><span begin="0:38.337" end="0:38.471">い</span><span begin="0:38.471" end="0:38.754">の</span></p><p begin="0:39.259" end="0:43.332" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:39.259" end="0:39.679">い</span><span begin="0:39.679" end="0:39.843">つ</span><span begin="0:39.843" end="0:40.026">も</span><span begin="0:40.210" end="0:40.394">御</span><span begin="0:40.394" end="0:40.714">別</span><span begin="0:40.714" end="0:40.914">れ</span><span begin="0:40.914" end="0:41.139">ば</span><span begin="0:41.139" end="0:41.347">か</span><span begin="0:41.347" end="0:41.500">り</span> <span begin="0:41.916" end="0:42.316">考</span><span begin="0:42.316" end="0:42.486">え</span><span begin="0:42.486" end="0:42.689">る</span><span begin="0:42.689" end="0:42.867">人</span><span begin="0:42.867" end="0:43.078">生</span><span begin="0:43.078" end="0:43.332">も</span></p><p begin="0:43.764" end="0:46.660" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:43.764" end="0:44.028">積</span><span begin="0:44.028" end="0:44.540">極</span><span begin="0:44.540" end="0:44.924">的</span><span begin="0:44.924" end="0:45.180">に</span><span begin="0:45.180" end="0:45.636">嬉</span><span begin="0:45.636" end="0:45.883">し</span><span begin="0:45.884" end="0:46.131">い</span><span begin="0:46.131" end="0:46.331">か</span><span begin="0:46.331" end="0:46.660">ら</span></p><p begin="0:46.868" end="0:49.173" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:46.868" end="0:47.236">会</span><span begin="0:47.236" end="0:47.383">え</span><span begin="0:47.383" end="0:47.584">ば</span><span begin="0:47.812" end="0:47.964">き</span><span begin="0:47.964" end="0:48.116">っ</span><span begin="0:48.116" end="0:48.259">と</span><span begin="0:48.259" end="0:48.413">足</span><span begin="0:48.413" end="0:48.572">り</span><span begin="0:48.572" end="0:48.757">な</span><span begin="0:48.757" end="0:48.971">く</span><span begin="0:48.971" end="0:49.173">て</span></p><p begin="0:49.411" end="0:52.786" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:49.411" end="0:49.757">会</span><span begin="0:49.757" end="0:49.932">話</span><span begin="0:49.932" end="0:50.100">の</span><span begin="0:50.100" end="0:50.284">切</span><span begin="0:50.284" end="0:50.427">れ</span><span begin="0:50.427" end="0:50.766">端</span><span begin="0:50.766" end="0:50.908">ま</span><span begin="0:50.908" end="0:51.002">で</span> <span begin="0:51.178" end="0:51.369">歌</span><span begin="0:51.369" end="0:51.578">詞</span><span begin="0:51.578" end="0:51.906">で</span><span begin="0:51.906" end="0:52.260">覚</span><span begin="0:52.260" end="0:52.433">え</span><span begin="0:52.433" end="0:52.593">る</span><span begin="0:52.593" end="0:52.786">の</span></p><p begin="0:53.017" end="0:54.202" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:53.017" end="0:53.234">向</span><span begin="0:53.234" end="0:53.457">い</span><span begin="0:53.457" end="0:53.714">て</span><span begin="0:53.714" end="0:53.930">く</span><span begin="0:53.930" end="0:54.202">る</span></p><p begin="0:54.418" end="0:58.390" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:54.418" end="0:54.629">引</span><span begin="0:54.629" end="0:54.840">っ</span><span begin="0:54.841" end="0:55.249">付</span><span begin="0:55.249" end="0:55.404">く</span><span begin="0:55.404" end="0:55.834">横</span><span begin="0:55.834" end="0:56.258">長</span><span begin="0:56.258" end="0:56.526">の</span><span begin="0:56.526" end="0:56.645">目</span> <span begin="0:57.039" end="0:57.261">鬱</span><span begin="0:57.261" end="0:57.685">陶</span><span begin="0:57.685" end="0:57.812">し</span><span begin="0:57.813" end="0:57.940">い</span><span begin="0:57.940" end="0:58.156">け</span><span begin="0:58.156" end="0:58.390">ど</span></p><p begin="0:58.893" end="1:01.421" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:58.893" end="0:59.103">逃</span><span begin="0:59.103" end="0:59.429">げ</span><span begin="0:59.429" end="0:59.589">る</span><span begin="0:59.589" end="0:59.862">準</span><span begin="0:59.862" end="1:00.062">備</span><span begin="1:00.062" end="1:00.301">に</span><span begin="1:00.301" end="1:00.694">疲</span><span begin="1:00.694" end="1:00.997">れ</span><span begin="1:00.997" end="1:01.221">た</span><span begin="1:01.221" end="1:01.421">わ</span></p><p begin="1:02.469" end="1:07.102" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:02.469" end="1:02.926">あ</span><span begin="1:02.926" end="1:03.366">な</span><span begin="1:03.366" end="1:03.845">た</span><span begin="1:03.845" end="1:04.173">に</span><span begin="1:04.334" end="1:04.926">幾</span><span begin="1:04.926" end="1:05.300">度</span><span begin="1:05.300" end="1:05.422">も</span> <span begin="1:05.797" end="1:06.101">触</span><span begin="1:06.101" end="1:06.261">れ</span><span begin="1:06.261" end="1:06.477">た</span><span begin="1:06.477" end="1:06.693">っ</span><span begin="1:06.693" end="1:07.102">て</span></p><p begin="1:07.277" end="1:09.765" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:07.277" end="1:07.651">大</span><span begin="1:07.651" end="1:08.102">体</span><span begin="1:08.102" end="1:08.246">ち</span><span begin="1:08.246" end="1:08.390">ょ</span><span begin="1:08.390" end="1:08.534">っ</span><span begin="1:08.534" end="1:08.669">と</span><span begin="1:08.669" end="1:08.824">だ</span><span begin="1:08.824" end="1:09.030">け</span> <span begin="1:09.030" end="1:09.510">頓</span><span begin="1:09.510" end="1:09.765">知</span></p><p begin="1:10.305" end="1:14.987" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:10.305" end="1:10.669">空</span><span begin="1:10.947" end="1:11.664">回</span><span begin="1:11.664" end="1:12.043">り</span><span begin="1:12.043" end="1:12.243">の</span><span begin="1:12.526" end="1:13.011">本</span><span begin="1:13.011" end="1:13.331">心</span> <span begin="1:13.491" end="1:14.044">隠</span><span begin="1:14.044" end="1:14.236">せ</span><span begin="1:14.236" end="1:14.531">ち</span><span begin="1:14.532" end="1:14.827">ゃ</span><span begin="1:14.827" end="1:14.987">う</span></p></div><div itunes:song-part="PreChorus"><p begin="1:15.660" end="1:17.509" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:15.660" end="1:15.804">あ</span><span begin="1:15.804" end="1:15.944">た</span><span begin="1:15.944" end="1:16.091">し</span><span begin="1:16.091" end="1:16.228">の</span><span begin="1:16.228" end="1:16.364">こ</span><span begin="1:16.364" end="1:16.579">と</span><span begin="1:16.579" end="1:16.763">知</span><span begin="1:16.763" end="1:16.933">ら</span><span begin="1:16.933" end="1:17.107">な</span><span begin="1:17.107" end="1:17.308">い</span><span begin="1:17.308" end="1:17.509">で</span></p><p begin="1:17.756" end="1:19.395" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:17.756" end="1:17.940">因</span><span begin="1:17.940" end="1:18.092">果</span><span begin="1:18.092" end="1:18.283">応</span><span begin="1:18.283" end="1:18.499">報</span><span begin="1:18.499" end="1:18.804">叱</span><span begin="1:18.804" end="1:18.947">ら</span><span begin="1:18.947" end="1:19.092">な</span><span begin="1:19.092" end="1:19.236">い</span><span begin="1:19.236" end="1:19.395">で</span></p><p begin="1:19.548" end="1:21.276" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:19.548" end="1:19.707">あ</span><span begin="1:19.707" end="1:19.843">た</span><span begin="1:19.843" end="1:19.963">し</span><span begin="1:19.963" end="1:20.091">の</span><span begin="1:20.091" end="1:20.236">こ</span><span begin="1:20.236" end="1:20.459">と</span><span begin="1:20.459" end="1:20.631">知</span><span begin="1:20.631" end="1:20.780">ら</span><span begin="1: